{"repositoryId":1252450001,"availability":"available","full":"Geph/dump-stat-character-builder","name":"dump-stat-character-builder","description":"A D&D 5.5e character builder with comprehensive support for custom classes and content","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":1,"created":"2026-05-28T14:30:28Z","updated":"2026-10-12T18:53:28Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://geph.github.io/dump-stat-character-builder/","topics":[],"demo":"https://geph.github.io/dump-stat-character-builder/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:46.701Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:46.701Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:46.701Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T19:08:46.701Z","stars":1,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A 5E-compatible character builder and compendium. Try the live app (static GitHub Pages, data stays in your browser). Current release: 0.29.","Maximally customizable by design. Nearly every mechanical decision — species, classes, subclasses, feats, spells, equipment, backgrounds, creatures & companions, custom abilities, and the modifier effects behind them — is editable in-app from a single shared catalog. The same wiring that powers the bundled SRD content can process your own imported homebrew.","Author and purpose. Hi all, I'm Jeff and this is a hobby project of mine. I made this app because I really wanted a character creator and interactive sheet that does custom classes! There are so many outstanding D&D content creators out there like Kibbles Tasty, Mage Hand Press or Laserllama who make content that's brilliant but too complicated to easily adapt to D&D Beyond or Foundry VTT (those are great and I think you should support them too!). While I'd like for this app to remain open source and free for everyone I won't say no if you'd like to buy me a coffee. The first thing I plan to…"],"features":["Guided creation through species, class, ability scores, background, gear, spells, and details","Multiclass with independent levels, plus a live sheet preview","Player-choice modifiers (skills, tools, languages, weapon masteries, feat grants) at the step where they apply","Point buy and standard array; HP, AC, attacks, saves, and skills calculate automatically","Seed the full SRD 5.2.1 catalog, then create or edit anything"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Geph/dump-stat-character-builder/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"7791d22fefdc2deec1d326b059397a3857e1b75ab65511b40cc0e403eeea0e5c","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:46.832Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:46.832Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A 5E-compatible character builder and compendium. Try the live app (static GitHub Pages, data stays in your browser). Current release: 0.29.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Geph/dump-stat-character-builder/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"7791d22fefdc2deec1d326b059397a3857e1b75ab65511b40cc0e403eeea0e5c","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Geph/dump-stat-character-builder/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:46.832Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-12T18:53:28Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Geph/dump-stat-character-builder/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:46.833Z","hash":"7791d22fefdc2deec1d326b059397a3857e1b75ab65511b40cc0e403eeea0e5c","originalBytes":13741,"storedBytes":13741,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["pnpm","mysql","app","srd","import","hosted","static","compendium","content","database","seed","server","deploy","docs","images","live","pages","dev","dump","json","public","scripts","stat","api","art","bash","build","builder","class","code","features","fonts","github","solbera","character","custom","data","git","indexeddb","lib","license","next","png","project","same","species","there","browser","bundled","card","contributing.md","corepack","does","env.local","found